<h3>Login request received</h3>

<p>
  We received a login link request for <strong><%= @email %></strong>, but we
  could not find an account registered to that address.
</p>

<p>
  If you made this request, you may have used a different email address when you
  signed up. Please try again with that address, or contact your administrator
  for access.
</p>

<p>
  If you did not make this request, you can safely ignore this email. No account
  has been created and no action is required.
</p>

<p style="color: #666; font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 2em;">
  For security reasons, the login page shows the same response whether or not an
  address is registered. This email is how we let you know when no account was found.
</p>
